    { "type": "header", "content": "Reseller / Brochure CTA" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "brochure_eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "Grow with us" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "brochure_title", "label": "Title", "default": "Want to bring Zyzven Naturals to your community?" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "brochure_text", "label": "Text", "default": "<p>Whether you are an independent entrepreneur, retailer, wellness professional or distributor, explore the opportunities to grow with us.</p>" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "brochure_btn_label", "label": "Button label", "default": "View Retail & Partner Brochure" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "brochure_btn_link", "label": "Button link" },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Women in Business spotlight" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "spot_eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "Real stories ¬∑ Women in business" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "spot_title", "label": "Title", "default": "The women building businesses with Zyzven Naturals" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "spot_lede", "label": "Intro", "default": "Creating opportunity has been part of Zyzven Naturals from the beginning. These are some of the women turning our products into businesses of their own - starting in Jamaica and growing across the communities we serve." },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "spot_foot", "label": "Closing line", "default": "<p>When Zyzven Naturals grows, we want that growth to create opportunity for other people too.</p>" },

    { "type": "header", "content": "International band" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "intl_eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "Chapter 12 ¬∑ International from day one" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "intl_title", "label": "Title", "default": "International was always the vision" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "intl_body", "label": "Body", "default": "<p>Even when Zyzven Naturals was small, we never thought of it as a brand limited to one town or one country. Our online community was already international - customers shared products with relatives and friends across borders. Today, we warehouse and fulfil according to the market being served, bringing products closer to customers through a more efficient international network.</p>" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "intl_image", "label": "International image (optional)" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "intl_image_note", "label": "Image placeholder note", "default": "Product cartons, warehouse stock or fulfilment imagery." },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "intl_path", "label": "Closing italic line", "default": "<p>We moved from handmade production to professional manufacturing, from one physical shop to international e-commerce, from local packing to multiple fulfilment locations, and from informal word-of-mouth sales to a growing international retailer and distribution network.</p>" },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Values band" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "values_eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "Who we're for" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "values_title", "label": "Title", "default": "Formulated for everyone, without forgetting who helped shape us" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "values_body", "label": "Body", "default": "<p>Zyzven Naturals products are for everyone. But we are particularly proud of the trust the brand has built within Black and Caribbean communities - where conversations around hormone health, fertility, menopause, metabolic wellness, hair loss and culturally familiar botanical traditions were not always being addressed in ways that reflected people's experiences. We created space for those conversations without needing to exclude anyone else.</p>" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "values_tag", "label": "Closing line", "default": "Our roots explain who we are. They do not determine who is welcome." },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Now we scale" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "scale_eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "Chapter 13 ¬∑ Now" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "scale_title", "label": "Title", "default": "Now, we are ready to scale" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "scale_body", "label": "Body (before quote)", "default": "<p>The story of Zyzven Naturals has never been perfectly linear. From a small ethnic shop in Sweden to products made in a kitchen in Jamaica. From hair oil to medicinal teas. From Facebook Lives to conversations about hormones, fertility and menopause that brought thousands of people into our community. From handmade products to professional manufacturing. From building momentum to having to start over in another country - and then rebuilding.</p><p>Zyzven Naturals today is not simply an idea with potential. It is a brand that has been tested by customers, by relocation, by changing markets and by the realities of building a company from the ground up. Our customer base was built largely organically rather than through paid advertising - our products travelled because people talked about them.</p><p>At the same time, we have spent years strengthening what sits behind that demand: formulations, testing, manufacturing relationships, international fulfilment, brand protection and a more professional retail and distribution structure. We now warehouse across the USA, UK, Canada, Sweden and Jamaica, while continuing to develop our international reach.</p>" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "scale_quote", "label": "Pull-quote", "default": "We are no longer trying to prove that Zyzven Naturals can work. We are preparing to scale what we have already proved can work." },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "scale_body_2", "label": "Body (after quote)", "default": "<p>We want customers who discover the brand to feel confident buying it. We want entrepreneurs and established retailers to see a product range they are proud to carry. We want distributors to see an opportunity to take an established story and proven formulations into new markets. And we want strategic partners to see a founder-led company with authentic origins, organic customer demand, international ambition, established infrastructure - and considerable room still left to grow.</p>" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "scale_stamp", "label": "Closing stamp", "default": "<p>Zyzven Naturals began because I needed answers. It grew because other people recognised themselves in the questions. It survived because Lawrence and I were willing to rebuild it when life changed. And it continues because our customers kept believing in what we were creating - strongly enough to tell someone else.</p><p><b>Rooted in heritage. Refined by knowledge. Formulated with purpose. Built for legacy.</b></p>" },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Final CTAs" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "finalcta_eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "Where would you like to go next?" },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Signoff" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "brand_name", "label": "Brand name", "default": "Zyzven Naturals" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "brand_tag", "label": "Tagline", "default": "Rooted in Heritage ¬∑ Built for Legacy" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "signoff_line", "label": "Signoff line", "default": "From our family to yours - and from St. Thomas, Jamaica, to the world." }
